- a statement that the Derivative Work is not an official version of the original Work.

The attribution must not imply endorsement, sponsorship, partnership, or official affiliation with the Author unless explicitly authorized in writing.

The attribution must be placed in a reasonable and reasonably visible location, such as a README, documentation, credits section, source file, application UI, or other location appropriate to the nature of the Work.

A Derivative Work must preserve existing copyright, license, and attribution notices from the Original Work, except where removal is technically necessary and the same information is reproduced in an equivalent or more appropriate location.

[ID]

Setiap distribusi publik, redistribusi, publikasi, atau pembagian Karya maupun Karya Turunan wajib menyertakan atribusi yang jelas, terlihat, dan pantas kepada Pembuat.

Atribusi wajib mencantumkan:

- nama "NexCaise" atau "NexCaise Team";
- pemberitahuan hak cipta dari Karya yang bersangkutan;
- tahun hak cipta asli Karya;
- tahun pembuatan Karya Turunan atau fork;
